boarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S019","name":"Remediation loop - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S020","name":"Maker-checker (4-eye) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S021","name":"Publish to onboarding master - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S022","name":"Write controls &amp; DQ metrics - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S023","name":"Distribute to Downstream Systems (transaction) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S024","name":"Publish to DDT (alias: External Consumer A (Market Data) or Downstream Consumer A) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S025","name":"Publish to Portfolio Analytics Platform (ANALYTICS CONSUMER B (HACKATHON) OR AZURE SYNAPSE/DATABRICKS ANALYTICS WORKSPACE) (alias: Analytics Platform) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S026","name":"Publish to Client Reporting Hub topic - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S027","name":"Record publication events - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S028","name":"Update DQ dashboard - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"},{"id":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S029","name":"Notify completion - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","disposition":"Retained as source evidence; no one-to-one executable mapping asserted"}],"source_evidence":{"process":{"Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Description":"Counterparty creation for treasury deals including sanctions checks","Process Repository Reference ID":"BUSINESS-TO-CPM-1005","Value Stream":"Treasury Operations","L2 Business Function":"Counterparty Management","Capability":"Master Data Utility","Data Sub-domain":"Treasury Data","Data Domain":"Treasury Operations - Counterparty Management","Business Data Domain Owner":"vidya","Business Data Domain Owner Delegate":"samba"},"steps":[{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":10,"Process Step":"Submit onboarding request - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Requestor submits onboarding requests with mandatory attributes and evidence references; Tracking ID created.","Data Involved":"Process attributes + evidence refs","Source BDEs":"Request Payload","Target BDEs":"Ticket Record","Data Transformed":"Minimal (format validation)","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S002","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":20,"Process Step":"Triage and classify - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Ops reviews request, classifies route (FD/SA), urgency, sets SLA and assigns maker.","Data Involved":"Ticket metadata","Source BDEs":"Ticket Record","Target BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Data Transformed":"Routing tags applied","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S003","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":30,"Process Step":"Completeness gateway - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Mandatory fields/evidence check; fail → AOB-PR-1005-V01-S004, pass → AOB-PR-1005-V01-S005.","Data Involved":"Process attributes + evidence refs","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Pass/Fail decision","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S004","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":40,"Process Step":"Request clarification (fail path) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Return to requestor with reason codes; loop to AOB-PR-1005-V01-S003.","Data Involved":"Missing field list","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Updated Ticket","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S005","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":50,"Process Step":"Business approval - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Business approver confirms request is valid and authorised.","Data Involved":"Key Process attributes","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Approved/Rejected","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S006","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":60,"Process Step":"Approval event gateway - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Wait for approve/reject/withdraw/timeout; timeout → escalation.","Data Involved":"Approval status","Source BDEs":"Approval Task","Target BDEs":"Outcome event","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S007","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":70,"Process Step":"Create onboarding draft - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Maker maps request to draft, creates v1 + change log.","Data Involved":"Process attributes","Source BDEs":"Approved Ticket","Target BDEs":"Draft Record v1","Data Transformed":"Standardisation + typing","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S008","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":80,"Process Step":"Package for ingestion - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Create ingestion package, apply naming/checksum/encryption.","Data Involved":"Draft Record","Source BDEs":"Draft Record v1","Target BDEs":"Ingestion Package","Data Transformed":"Canonical field mapping","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S009","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":90,"Process Step":"Ingest to landing - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Platform ingests package; schema validation.","Data Involved":"Draft + metadata","Source BDEs":"Ingestion Package","Target BDEs":"Landing Record","Data Transformed":"Schema/format coercion","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S010","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":100,"Process Step":"Technical error handling - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Incident created; retry/park decision (max 2 retries).","Data Involved":"Error details","Source BDEs":"Ingest logs","Target BDEs":"Incident/Retry/Parked","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S011","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":110,"Process Step":"Parallel validations start - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Run DQ, enrichment, duplicate detection in parallel; join at AOB-PR-1005-V01-S015.","Data Involved":"Landing record","Source BDEs":"Landing Record","Target BDEs":"Validation outputs","Data Transformed":"Varies","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S012","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":120,"Process Step":"Execute DQ ruleset - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Automated DQ checks: completeness, code sets, date logic, uniqueness.","Data Involved":"Landing record","Source BDEs":"Landing Record","Target BDEs":"DQ Results","Data Transformed":"Flags/scores calculated","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S013","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":130,"Process Step":"Reference enrichment - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Standardize country/currency/team codes.","Data Involved":"Landing record","Source BDEs":"Landing Record","Target BDEs":"Enriched Record","Data Transformed":"Lookup + normalisation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S014","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":140,"Process Step":"Duplicate detect &amp; merge decision - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Detect duplicates; merge/reject/proceed decision.","Data Involved":"Identity fields","Source BDEs":"Enriched Record","Target BDEs":"Merge Outcome","Data Transformed":"Fuzzy match + survivorship","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S015","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":150,"Process Step":"Validation join - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Consolidate parallel outputs into Validated Draft.","Data Involved":"DQ + enriched + merge","Source BDEs":"DQ/Enriched/Merge Results","Target BDEs":"Validated Draft","Data Transformed":"Consolidation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S016","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":160,"Process Step":"Conditional SPECIALIST checks - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Determine if Process SPECIALIST review is required based on explicit Tax Review Basis derived from Process Status and Process Type.","Data Involved":"Tax review routing data","Source BDEs":"Validated Draft","Target BDEs":"Specialist Review Flag","Data Transformed":"Rule evaluation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S017","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":170,"Process Step":"Process SPECIALIST review (conditional) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"SPECIALIST reviews tax-triggered cases.","Data Involved":"Tax review routing data","Source BDEs":"Validated Draft","Target BDEs":"Tax Approved / Correction Required","Data Transformed":"Possible corrections","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S018","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":180,"Process Step":"DQ pass gateway - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Evaluate DQ + Merge + Specialist outcomes; fail → AOB-PR-1005-V01-S019, pass → AOB-PR-1005-V01-S020.","Data Involved":"DQ + merge + specialist outcomes","Source BDEs":"Validated Draft","Target BDEs":"Pass/Fail decision","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S019","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":190,"Process Step":"Remediation loop - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Maker corrects and resubmits; max 3 attempts; loop to AOB-PR-1005-V01-S011.","Data Involved":"Failed fields","Source BDEs":"Fail reasons + draft","Target BDEs":"Corrected Draft / Parked","Data Transformed":"Data corrections","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S020","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":200,"Process Step":"Maker-checker (4-eye) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Checker reviews, approves/rejects with reasons; logged for audit.","Data Involved":"Approved candidate","Source BDEs":"Validated/Corrected Draft","Target BDEs":"Checker Outcome","Data Transformed":"Controlled edits + audit","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S021","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":210,"Process Step":"Publish to onboarding master - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Publish to Azure Data Lake master; stamp lineage/audit.","Data Involved":"Approved record","Source BDEs":"Checker Approved Draft","Target BDEs":"Onboarding Master Record","Data Transformed":"Audit stamping","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S022","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":220,"Process Step":"Write controls &amp; DQ metrics - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Persist DQ results, approvals, remediation history to controls dataset.","Data Involved":"Control metrics","Source BDEs":"DQ/Workflow outputs","Target BDEs":"Controls &amp; DQ Record","Data Transformed":"Aggregation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S023","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":230,"Process Step":"Distribute to Downstream Systems (transaction) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Parallel fan-out; record per-consumer status; allow replay.","Data Involved":"Published record","Source BDEs":"Onboarding Master Record","Target BDEs":"Consumer payloads + statuses","Data Transformed":"Consumer mapping","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S024","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":240,"Process Step":"Publish to DDT (alias: External Consumer A (Market Data) or Downstream Consumer A) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Produce DDT-specific extract and deliver.","Data Involved":"Consumer payload","Source BDEs":"Consumer payload","Target BDEs":"DDT delivery","Data Transformed":"Schema mapping","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S025","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":250,"Process Step":"Publish to Portfolio Analytics Platform (ANALYTICS CONSUMER B (HACKATHON) OR AZURE SYNAPSE/DATABRICKS ANALYTICS WORKSPACE) (alias: Analytics Platform) - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Deliver via API MANAGEMENT + AZURE FUNCTIONS (OR API INTEGRATION LAYER (AZURE API MANAGEMENT)) to Analytics Consumer B with retries and idempotency using Tracking ID.","Data Involved":"Consumer payload","Source BDEs":"Consumer payload","Target BDEs":"Analytics delivery","Data Transformed":"Schema mapping","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S026","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":260,"Process Step":"Publish to Client Reporting Hub topic - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Publish event/message to Reporting Consumer C (Hackathon) or Downstream Reporting Hub (Consumer C) via Azure Service Bus Topic.","Data Involved":"Consumer payload","Source BDEs":"Consumer payload","Target BDEs":"CRH message","Data Transformed":"Event translation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S027","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":270,"Process Step":"Record publication events - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Append delivery events for audit/replay/monitoring.","Data Involved":"Event data","Source BDEs":"Delivery outcomes","Target BDEs":"Publication Events","Data Transformed":"Event normalisation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S028","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":280,"Process Step":"Update DQ dashboard - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Refresh dashboard with status + DQ metrics.","Data Involved":"Metrics","Source BDEs":"Controls &amp; DQ Record","Target BDEs":"Dashboard view","Data Transformed":"Aggregation","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S029","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01","Reorder":290,"Process Step":"Notify completion - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Process Step Description":"Notify requestor/stakeholders with outcome + Tracking ID.","Data Involved":"Status","Source BDEs":"Publication Events","Target BDEs":"Notifications","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Treasury Counterparty Onboarding"}],"details":[{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001-01","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001","Process Step":"Submit onboarding request - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Detail Type":"Application","Detail Value":"Work Tracking Tool (Azure DevOps Boards)","Process Step Owner":"Requestor","RACI":"R=Requestor, A=Approver, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001-02","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001","Process Step":"Submit onboarding request - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Detail Type":"Input","Detail Value":"Process attributes + Supporting Evidence References","Process Step Owner":"Requestor","RACI":"R=Requestor, A=Approver, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001-03","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001","Process Step":"Submit onboarding request - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Detail Type":"Tracking","Detail Value":"Create Tracking ID (Correlation ID) at intake; persist end-to-end","Process Step Owner":"Requestor","RACI":"R=Requestor, A=Approver, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001-04","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S001","Process Step":"Submit onboarding request - Treasury Counterparty Onboarding","Detail Type":"Output","Detail Value":"Ticket contains submitted Process attributes, Supporting Evidence References, and Tracking ID","Process Step Owner":"Requestor","RACI":"R=Requestor, A=Approver, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1005-V01-S002-01","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1005-V01-S002","Process St